# Security Assessment Report (SAR)
**System Name:** DMP Consulting Internal Business App
**Date:** 07/15/2026

## 1. Executive Summary
An independent security assessment was conducted on the Azure cloud infrastructure supporting the SecureGov Internal Business App to determine compliance with NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 requirements. 

The assessment identified **4** total vulnerabilities:
*   **1 Critical-risk finding** related to inadequate network boundary protection (SC-7).
*   **2 High-risk findings** related to unauthorized data access (AC-3) and cryptographic key management (SC-12).
*   **1 Moderate-risk finding** related to transmission encryption (SC-8).

**Recommendation:**
The system currently presents an unacceptable level of risk to the organization. It is recommended that the system be denied an Authorization to Operate (ATO) until the Critical and High-risk vulnerabilities are remediated and validated. A formal Plan of Action and Milestones (POA&M) must be developed to track remediation efforts.